Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.17,0:03:17.30,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)}私は煌めく
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.39,0:03:20.31,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}見上げてごらん
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.31,0:03:22.47,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\an3\pos(1840,1020)}見上げてごらん
